# Chrome downloads are REQUIRED: resume PDFs are rendered by Puppeteer, and
# without a browser the server silently falls back to PDFKit, which ignores the
# HTML templates entirely. These two flags previously skipped the download, so
# templates rendered correctly on a Mac (which has Chrome in /Applications) and
# generically in production.
#
#   puppeteer_skip_chromium_download=true
#   PUPPETEER_SKIP_DOWNLOAD=true
#
# To opt out on a machine that already has Chrome, set PUPPETEER_SKIP_DOWNLOAD
# in the environment and point PUPPETEER_EXECUTABLE_PATH at it.
